# Listing Engine

## Entry

- **Not a top-level tab.** BizStart Germany → `listingEngine` screen (`StepListingEngine` → `ListingEngineBuilder`).
- Nested like TailorCV / Website-Rechtliches.

## Principles

- V1: **Can I Sell This?** · Make Listing Ready · German Copywriter · SEO · Compliance · Profit · Image plan · Publish Readiness · single OAuth publish.
- **V2 Catalog (ListFlow ops):** multi-product CSV/JSON import → price/policy → human review queue → capped batch publish via official Sell Inventory API · stock/price sync · dry-run by default.
- Never invent specs, GPSR, shipping times, certifications, or legal text.
- German Copywriter modes include `correct` (fix spelling/wrong words/Denglisch) on Listing tab and Katalog → „Deutsche Kopie korrigieren“.
- Legal modules (Impressum, Widerruf, AGB, Datenschutz) are locked templates — insert only.
- Human approval required; no auto-publish unless `auto_approve_enabled` after clean track record.
- Client-side `mergeComplianceGuards` after LLM compliance; RED claims stripped from marketing text.
- Profit fees are **estimates** — not live eBay fee API.
- Supplier data: licensed feeds only (CSV/JSON). Do **not** scrape Amazon/AliExpress/etc.
- Official eBay REST only — no browser automation against eBay UI.

